\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"73531006\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch Rust Protection Submersible Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241532338407305.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We believe in that only with sincerity and loyalty can we win our customers’ heart and trust. The sincerity equals with the attention we have paid to the procedure of making quality pumps and the loyalty refers to the polite and considerate service we offer to our customers. And 4 Inch Rust Protection Submersible Pump is one of the quality pumps we make.</p><p><strong style=\"white-space: normal;\"><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241532313019150.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Model</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor power (kw)</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor power (hp)</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Outlet</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Capacity</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4SP8</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.75-7.5kw</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1-10hp</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">G1 1/2~2&amp;rdquo;</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0-11 m³/h</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Head</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Length</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Phase</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Max. Dia.</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Q. max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"92\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">10-264 m</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">631-2274mm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Single phase/ Three phase</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"98\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">98 mm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"114\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">14.5 m³/h</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241534328980361.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Copper Motor<br/><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241535407931414.jpg\"/> <br/>·50Hz or 60Hz available<br/>·High speed and efficiency<br/>·With food grade oil never pollute the water</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Various Choices<br/><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241535516938751.jpg\"/> <br/>·Materials for oil chamber, suction chamber and outlet could be chosen: Copper/ Iron/ Stainless steel</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Bearing<br/><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241536033619856.jpg\"/> <br/>·C&amp;U brand(#7204), longer working life<br/>·To make the motor work more stably</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Mechanical Seal<br/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241536121656081.jpg\"/> <br/>·Do not damage the pump shaft or sleeve.<br/>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Control Box  <br/><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241536289682359.jpg\"/> <br/>·Prevent the motor from accidents<br/>·Offer different plug</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Cable<br/><img alt=\"image020(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241536413762519.jpg\"/></p><p>·Four cores cable<br/>·Various colors (blue, black, green and so on) available<br/>·Cable produced by JIADI</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>Domestic water supply</p><p>Agriculture irrigation</p><p>Control of desert</p><p>Animal husbandry</p><p>Water supply for Sea Island</p><p>Water treatment projects</p><p><strong>5. How to choose</strong></p><p>1. Confirm your technical requirement</p><p>How deep is your well (bore well)</p><p>How far is the distance between tank and well?</p><p>What’s your requirement about the flow (L/H)?</p><p>2. Compare your requirement with our product</p><p>Calculate “Actual Pump Head” and find the proper pump with the right head.</p><p>Then you can choose the pump you want according to different flow and prices. </p><p><strong>6. Company profile</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image021(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241538328017632.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>Since 1998, JIADI PUMP INDUSTRY CO., LTD. has been making pumps intently and professionally. Also, we devote ourselves to offer better service for customers. Because we are a manufacturer, we are able to give our customers competitive price. Products are widel